# Assassin's Trophy: the search is not conditional on the destruction (ruling: "If the target permanent is a legal target but
# isn't destroyed ... its controller may search their library"). Bot2 regenerates its Llanowar Elves with Yavimaya Hollow in
# response (CR 701.19a): the Elves are tapped and stay, and Bot2 is still asked and fetches a Swamp, untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Assassin's Trophy
Plains x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Yavimaya Hollow
Forest x4
Forest x3
Swamp
Forest x9

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Yavimaya Hollow.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Assassin's Trophy.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Yavimaya Hollow.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Regenerate)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Search(Swamp)

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Assassin's Trophy
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Llanowar Elves; Yavimaya Hollow; Swamp
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Tapped = false
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
